# Derico Motors - UI Prototype Specification

Use this file as the brief for building a clickable UI prototype (Figma, or a coded prototype in React + Tailwind). It covers the **public website** and the **admin dashboard**, with a detailed **Inventory** module (brands + searchable properties) and the **WhatsApp API** layer.

> Prototype rules: use realistic fake data (section 12), no real backend, no client accounts. Only the admin logs in. Prices are in **XAF (FCFA)**. Languages: **EN / FR** toggle. Time zone: WAT.

---

