## 6. INVENTORY (Sales) - detailed design

This is the core module the prototype must get right. Three screens work together: **Cars**, **Brands and models**, **Vehicle properties**.

### 6.1 Cars for sale (list)
- Table columns: photo, title, brand, model, year, price (XAF), status, views, requests, updated.
- Filters: brand, status, body type, price, year.
- Top-right: **+ Add car**, **Import CSV**, **Export**.
- Row actions: Edit, Duplicate, Mark reserved, Mark sold (opens receipt flow), Archive, Delete.
- Toggle between Table view and Grid view.
- Bulk actions: publish, unpublish, change status, delete.

### 6.2 Brands and models
Split layout.

**Left panel: Brands**
- Search box and **+ Add brand** button.
- List of brand rows: drag handle (reorder), logo, name, number of cars, "Featured" star toggle, visible toggle, edit and delete icons.
- Add/Edit brand drawer fields:
  - Brand name (required)
  - Logo upload (square, PNG/SVG, preview)
  - Slug (auto-generated, editable)
  - Short description (shown on brand page)
  - Featured on home (toggle)
  - Visible on website (toggle)
  - Display order (drag)

**Right panel: Models of the selected brand**
- Header: brand logo + name, "+ Add model" button.
- Model rows: drag handle, model name, body type default, years available, number of cars, visible toggle, edit, delete.
- Add model fields: model name, default body type, optional image.
- Inline quick-add: type a model name and press Enter.

**Rules shown in the UI:**
- Deleting a brand with cars shows a blocking modal: "12 cars use this brand. Reassign or archive them first."
- Empty state: "No brands yet. Add your first brand, for example Toyota."
- Suggested brands row (one-tap add): Toyota, Mercedes-Benz, Hyundai, Kia, Nissan, Peugeot, Honda, Ford, Volkswagen, Mitsubishi, Suzuki, Renault, BMW, Land Rover, Isuzu.

### 6.3 Vehicle properties (searchable attributes, independent of brand)
A library of **properties** that describe any car regardless of brand, so buyers can search by what they care about. Whatever the admin creates here automatically becomes (a) a field on the Add car form and (b) a filter on the public Buy Cars page.

**Screen layout:** list of properties grouped in collapsible sections (General, Engine and performance, Body and interior, Safety, Features and comfort, Commercial), with drag-to-reorder and a toggle row. **+ Add property** button top right. Search box.

**Property row:** drag handle, name, type tag, "Filter" toggle, "Required" toggle, "Visible on card" toggle, edit and delete.

**Add / Edit property drawer fields:**

| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Property name | e.g. Fuel type |
| Group | General / Engine / Body / Safety / Features / Commercial / custom |
| Input type | Single select (dropdown), Multi select (checkboxes), Number, Number range, Yes/No, Short text, Colour |
| Options | For selects: add, rename, reorder options (chips). e.g. Petrol, Diesel, Hybrid, Electric |
| Unit | For numbers: km, cc, hp, seats, doors, litres... |
| Show as public filter | Toggle. Choose filter style: checkbox list, dropdown, slider, toggle |
| Required when adding a car | Toggle |
| Show on car card | Toggle (max 3 properties on card) |
| Applies to | Cars for sale / Rental cars / Pick-up vehicles (multi-select) |
| Display order | Drag |

