## 8. Billing: invoices and sales receipts

### 8.1 Invoices (services)
- List: number (DM-INV-2026-0001), client, linked booking, total (XAF), paid, balance, status (Draft, Sent, Partially paid, Paid, Overdue, Cancelled), due date. Actions: View PDF, Send on WhatsApp, Send email, Record payment, Void.
